      "title": "TDS: Prevent signed overflow",
      "message": "TDS: Prevent signed overflow\n\nDon't fetch the featureackdatalen before we know if it's present\n(i.e., if the featureid is the terminator 0xff) but instead get it\nwith proto_tree_add_item_ret_uint. Set the length of the parent tree\nafter adding the feature data, which will throw an exception if\noverflow would occur.\n\nOSS-Fuzz 450116221\n",
